<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.AFRICA'S SASANI SAYS TALKS STOPPED.</title>
<headline>S.AFRICA'S SASANI SAYS TALKS STOPPED.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African media group Sasani Ltd said on Friday that it was withdrawing a cautionary announcement on its shares as talks that may have had an impact on its share price had been discontinued.</p>
<p>The firm gave no further details in a brief statement.</p>
